@startuml UC-103 View Staff Detail - Sequence Diagram (icon)
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #000000
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #000000
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 280
title 2.19.2.2 UC-103 View Staff Detail — Sequence Diagram

actor Principal
boundary ":UserManagementPage" as LIST
boundary ":UserProfileViewPage" as UI
control ":UserController" as CTL
control ":UserProfileViewService" as SVC
boundary ":AppUserRepository" as USERS
boundary ":UserRoleRepository" as ROLES
database DB

autonumber
Principal ->> LIST : Select the name of a Moderator or of the IT Supporter in the Staff List
activate LIST
LIST ->> UI : open the read-only profile route of the selected account
deactivate LIST
activate UI
UI ->> UI : load()
UI ->> CTL : GET /api/users/{id}/profile
activate CTL
CTL ->> SVC : view(targetId)
activate SVC
SVC ->> USERS : findById(targetId)
activate USERS
USERS ->> DB : SELECT * FROM app_users WHERE id = ?
activate DB
DB -->> USERS : row / none
deactivate DB
USERS -->> SVC : AppUser
deactivate USERS
SVC ->> ROLES : findRolesByUserId(targetId)
activate ROLES
ROLES ->> DB : SELECT the granted role FROM user_roles WHERE user_id = ?
activate DB
DB -->> ROLES : row / none
deactivate DB
ROLES -->> SVC : Role [0..*]
deactivate ROLES
SVC ->> SVC : accept only an existing Moderator or IT Staff account that is not DISABLED and is visible to the Principal

alt the selected account does not exist, is DISABLED or is out of the Principal's scope
  SVC -->> CTL : ResourceNotFoundException / ForbiddenOperationException
  CTL -->> UI : HTTP 404 / 403
  UI -->> Principal : Show the unavailable-account message and no stored data is changed
else the selected staff account is visible to the Principal
  SVC ->> ROLES : findGrantedAtsByUserIds(userIds, role)
  activate ROLES
  ROLES -->> SVC : Map<String, Date>
  deactivate ROLES
  SVC -->> CTL : UserProfileView
  CTL -->> UI : HTTP 200 + UserProfileView
  UI -->> Principal : Show the full name, position, email, subject, grades, granted date and granting account
end
deactivate SVC
deactivate CTL
deactivate UI
@enduml
